{
  "description": "Expose ResourceNotFound for HTTP 404 responses whose errors[0].code is resource_not_found. Clerk's official error catalogue (https://clerk.com/docs/guides/development/errors/platform-api) documents this envelope for ResourceNotFound and resource-specific not-found errors. The current pinned official spec (https://github.com/clerk/openapi-specs/blob/94753d1d8a648806e4dc529beec8bb76daa13859/platform/beta.yml) references components/responses/ResourceNotFound on exactly the 64 operations patched here; no association is inferred for operations without a documented 404. The body-matcher approach follows the #702 maintainer guidance (https://github.com/alchemy-run/distilled/pull/702#issuecomment-6345622952), without its rejected string-code forwarding changes. Existing generic NotFound remains the fallback for other 404 bodies, and code retains the generator's numeric type. No live resource probes were performed.",
  "patches": [
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/shapes/com.clerk.platform#ResourceNotFound",
      "value": {
        "type": "structure",
        "members": {},
        "traits": {
          "smithy.api#error": "client",
          "smithy.api#httpError": 404,
          "smithy.api#documentation": "The requested resource was not found (Clerk resource_not_found, HTTP 404).",
          "com.distilled.openapi#errorMatchers": [
            {
              "status": 404,
              "body": {
                "/errors/0/code": "resource_not_found"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
